Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 05:46:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Customer app price feed: CustomerApp:TenantId 6 in
 appsettings so any restart keeps it on (set your own company on a hosted
 server)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 appsettings.json | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/appsettings.json b/appsettings.json
index ae4c679..5d007b5 100644
--- a/appsettings.json
+++ b/appsettings.json
@@ -27,6 +27,9 @@
   "Swagger": {  
     "Enabled": true
   },
+  "CustomerApp": {
+    "TenantId": 6
+  },
   "DefaultCustomerId": 1,
   "AllowedHosts": "*"
 }
